Regarding protection from priests. To be honest, I think the whole
thing is a bit bork. The protection is very powerful, and yet
unspoiled players are likely to never find out about it. The 400g per
level is yet another disincentive to leveling up, and it's too cheap
at low levels. .. and there are other thing about it that I dislike as
well. I'm tempted to just scrap the whole thing, ie. have no bought
protection whatsoever. The only real thing I like about bought
protection is that it's the only way in the game to spend the large
amounts of gold. I personally make a habit of trying to ascend with as
much gold and gems as I can get my hands on, but it sure is nice to
have way to spend the gold while still in the dungeon. Anyway, I
dislike the protection system. I'd prefer to vastly increase the price
and decrease the level dependence, but... well the current donation
system has other effects as well, and I'm not quite ready to mess
around with it that much.

