Finally, unrelated to the invincibility issue, I have one more change
in mind that I intend to implement: levitation should not help in the
plane of water. As I understand it, the plane of water level is meant
to be played in a bubble underwater somewhere. So it doesn't really
make sense that you can walk out of the bubble and then levitate above
the water without getting wet. How the hell do you get in and out of
the bubble without going through the water? In my opinion, it should
only be safe to move between bubbles if you have magical breathing.
Levitation should not help at all. The plane of air is already a
levitation level.


